Adult\"). NA, uses first life stage found species. CP proportion maximum consumption (default 0.5) FA egestion proportion (proportion food gets passed ) (default 0.1018428) UA excretion proportion (proportion assimilated allocated towards metabolism gonad growth) (default 0.08743042) SDA specific dynamic action, proportion energy going digestion (default 0.150819) ED energy density (J/kg) (default 3983.646)","code":""},{"path":"https://bomeara.github.io/fishyenergy/reference/BEM_from_FB4.html","id":"value","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Value","title":"Create a BEM object from FB4 data — bem_from_fb4","text":"BEM object parameters specified species life stage","code":""},{"path":"https://bomeara.github.io/fishyenergy/reference/Find_Closest_FB4_Species.html","id":null,"dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Find closest relatives of a species in the FB4 dataset — fb4_closest_species","title":"Find closest relatives of a species in the FB4 dataset — fb4_closest_species","text":"uses Open Tree Life find relatives species.","code":""},{"path":"https://bomeara.github.io/fishyenergy/reference/Find_Closest_FB4_Species.html","id":"ref-usage","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Usage","title":"Find closest relatives of a species in the FB4 dataset — fb4_closest_species","text":"","code":"fb4_closest_species(species)"},{"path":"https://bomeara.github.io/fishyenergy/reference/Find_Closest_FB4_Species.html","id":"arguments","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Arguments","title":"Find closest relatives of a species in the FB4 dataset — fb4_closest_species","text":"species Scientific name species (e.g. \"Micropterus salmoides\")","code":""},{"path":"https://bomeara.github.io/fishyenergy/reference/Find_Closest_FB4_Species.html","id":"value","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Value","title":"Find closest relatives of a species in the FB4 dataset — fb4_closest_species","text":"vector scientific names closest relative